      "name": "bash",
      "arguments": "{\"command\":\"python - <<'PY'\\nW=[[2,1,0,1],[1,2,1,0]]\\ndef direct(x,y):\\n return sum((1 if x>0 else -1)*(1 if y>0 else -1)*W[j%2][i%4] for i in range(min(0,x),max(0,x)) for j in range(min(0,y),max(0,y)))\\ndef p(x,y):\\n qx,rx=divmod(x,4); qy,ry=divmod(y,2)\\n a=sum(W[j][i] for j in range(ry) for i in range(4));b=sum(W[j][i] for j in range(2) for i in range(rx));c=sum(W[j][i] for j in range(ry) for i in range(rx))\\n return qx*qy*8+qx*a+qy*b+c\\nfor x in range(-8,9):\\n for y in range(-6,7):\\n  if direct(x,y)!=p(x,y): print('bad',x,y,direct(x,y),p(x,y)); raise SystemExit\\nprint('all okay')\\nPY\"}",
